Subject: [PATCH 2/6] wifi: mt76: mt7915: validate RX descriptors and frame headers

Adapt the supplied RC1 RX entry/group guards to current upstream. Bound
direct accesses by the linear head, not the total fragmented skb length.
Validate payload and padding before header conversion, CCMP insertion and
QoS reads. Linearize control skbs before raw-buffer consumers.

Only decode HE radiotap when group 5 supplies the C-RXV, and avoid an
unneeded rxv[2] read for chips whose group 3 has only two words.

